jobs_results.description:
Thundersoft is looking for a Stability Test Engineer in Madrid, Spain to join our team of experts in the telecommunications industry.

Responsibilities:
• Responsible for system test use case execution and output test report;
• Responsible for stability test (MTBF, pressure test) implementation, problem analysis and problem tracking;
• Test case and scheme design, automation environment construction and maintenance, etc.;
• Good communication skills to promote problem solving.

Requirements:
• More than 1 year working experience in stability testing;
• Familiar with software testing process and specifications, familiar with software testing methods;
• Familiar with Android system, monkey, etc., able to use python to write basic scripts;
• Strong logical analysis ability and learning ability;
• Strong ability to work under pressure, have initiative, and can finish work efficiently.
• English B2, Spanish

